                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "11 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This small stir-fry restaurant is located in the old established Huaxi Street Night Market.\nThere are only 5 or 6 tables inside, larger groups not recommended.\nI think the lady boss was the cook herself and there was another lady who handled the orders and cash.\nThe food was very local and had a home-cook feel. Portion was not large but there was quite a variety you can pick from the menu.\nOrdered a clam sauteed with sponge gourd丝瓜 (this is very delicious!) and shrimp omelette - All the ingredients were very fresh. The place was \"mildly\" air-conditioned. They also serve beer \u0026 hot pots. I enjoyed the meal very much and recommended.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
